                "description": "Made out of rough iron, the Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Lockset With Knob will add a rustic touch to any home. It is available in either a single cylinder function or a dummy function. For exterior and interior use, it is guaranteed not to rust. The rough iron handleset features heart shaped mounting ends and a half round knob. For doors 1-3/4 inches - 3 inches thick with a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
